# Packages published to https://apt.skymob.app — this file IS the promotion
# decision. The publish workflow downloads exactly what is named here and
# nothing else, so cutting a release upstream never reaches customers on its
# own; someone has to add the line.
#
# Format: "<package> <version>", one per line. <version> must match a
# <package>-v<version> release tag in SkyMobDev/iot-edge.
#
# Keep the previous version listed too: apt installs the newest by default,
# and the older one in the pool is what makes `apt install skbridge=<old>`
# work when a site has to go back.

skbridge 0.1.26
skbridge 0.1.24
